<title>UK: ICCO lists buffer stock cocoa for sale in March.</title>
<headline>ICCO lists buffer stock cocoa for sale in March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The buffer stock manager of the International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) announced late on Friday the buffer stock sales planned for March would total a maximum 4,250 tonnes and would comprise the following cocoa, an ICCO news release said.</p>
<p>The date of the sale has yet to be announced.</p>
<p>The following parcels to be sold on description:</p>
<p>TONNES ORIGIN	     PORT	 CROP	  QUALITY</p>
<p> 49   Cameroon	  Rotterdam    1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p>224   Ivory Coast     Amsterdam    1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p>320   Ivory Coast     Amsterdam    1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p>765   Ivory Coast     Rotterdam    1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p>275   Ivory Coast     Rotterdam    1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p>The following parcels to be sold on description, contract terms subject to rules and regulations for in store cocoa:</p>
<p>TONNES ORIGIN	     PORT	 CROP	  QUALITY</p>
<p>690   Ghana	     Rotterdam    1986/87     good fermented</p>
<p>294   Ghana	     Rotterdam    1986/87     fair fermented</p>
<p> 48   Ghana	     Rotterdam    1987/88     good fermented</p>
<p>100   Ghana	     Rotterdam    1987/88     fair fermented</p>
<p> 99   Nigeria	   Rotterdam    1980/81     good fermented</p>
<p>241   Nigeria	   Rotterdam    1980/81     fair fermented</p>
<p>148   Nigeria	   Rotterdam    1986/87     good fermented</p>
<p>322   Nigeria	   Rotterdam    1986/87     fair fermented</p>
<p> 94   Togo		Rotterdam    1987/88     good fermented</p>
<p>The following parcels to be sold &quot;as seen&quot;:</p>
<p>TONNES  ORIGIN  PORT	   CROP YEAR   INDICATION OF</p>
<p>						     CONDITION</p>
<p> 90     Bahia   Antwerp	1987/88     Light damage</p>
<p> 90     Bahia   Antwerp	1987/88     Medium damage</p>
<p> 98     Bahia   Antwerp	1987/88     Heavy damage</p>
<p> 23     Ghana   Antwerp	1981/82     Light damage</p>
<p>  5     Ghana   Antwerp	1981/82     Heavy damage</p>
<p> 59    Nigeria  Antwerp	1980/81     Light damage</p>
<p>  7    Nigeria  Antwerp	1980/81     Heavy damage</p>
<p>  9    Nigeria  Antwerp	1986/87     Light damage</p>
<p>  1    Nigeria  Antwerp	1986/87     Heavy damage</p>
<p>-- Clelia Oziel, London Newsroom +44-171-542 8072</p>
